# Normalise to LF in the repository and on checkout.
#
# bundle/ matters most: concepts are written with LF deliberately so a bundle is
# byte-identical across platforms. Without this, git checkout on Windows rewrites
# them to CRLF and every content hash and diff shifts for no reason.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
*.npy binary
